  "question": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>80</mn></math>&nbsp;mole percent of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>MgCl</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> is dissociated in aqueous solution. The vapour pressure of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn></math> molal aqueous solution of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>MgCl</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>38</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>&nbsp;is _____ <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>mm</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Hg</mi></math>. (Nearest integer)</p><p>Given: Vapour pressure of water at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>38</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>&nbsp;is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>50</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mm</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Hg</mi></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "48",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>One molal solution means one of solute present in one kg of solvent.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>MgCl</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mover><mo>&#8652;</mo><mrow></mrow></mover><msup><mi>Mg</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>Cl</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p>Hence, overall moles&nbsp;after dissociation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p>The relative lowering of vapour pressure</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></msub></mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>moles</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>of</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>solute</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>moles</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>of</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>solute</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>moles</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>of</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>solvent</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>&#176;</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1000</mn><mn>18</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn></mstyle></mfrac></math></p><p>For dilute solution</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>&#176;</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1000</mn><mn>18</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>47</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>66</mn><mo>&#8771;</mo><mn>48</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mm</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Hg</mi></math></p>",
